Rule 1 (logical_not input tensor should have bool dtype or be convertible to bool)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ dtype_(v_1) = bool ∧ shape(v_1, 0) > 0 ∧ v_1 ≠ 0
