Rule 3 (logical_not output tensor should match input tensor dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0)
>>
Rule 7 (logical_not input tensor should not be empty)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) > 0 ∧ v_1 ≠ 0
